---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于">
  <Header />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="card">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold" style="color: var(--color-text);">关于</h1>
      <div class="prose-blog mt-8">
        <p>你好，欢迎来到 <strong>流雲の宝藏</strong>。</p>
        <p>这里是一个用来记录技术笔记、生活随笔与零散想法的个人角落。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
